    "Xi (W4) sums over ENERGY-DISTINCT eigenpairs (degeneracy grouping tol 1e-10): required by the spec's own defining property 'Xi > 0 iff the state moves under H', which fails for label-based m != n on the degenerate XX spectrum. Session-log delta; exploratory pilot Xi values for XX-based groups shift slightly.",
