    "Switch-off (\u00a74.2) for T-A/T-C coincides with the \u00a74.1 diagonal ensemble: dephasing psi(t_off) in the H eigenbasis yields exactly rho_bar (populations are conserved), so one computation serves both; reported under both headings.",
